## 1. Introduction

Autonomous System for Trading and Risk Analysis (hereafter referred to as **ASTRA**) is proprietary software developed to provide market analysis, trading research, strategy evaluation, risk analysis, portfolio monitoring, and related analytical capabilities.

This agreement establishes the terms under which ASTRA and its associated components may be accessed, installed, executed, or used.

ASTRA is distributed under a closed-source proprietary licensing model. No rights are granted except those explicitly stated in this agreement or separately authorized in writing by the Copyright Holder.

By accessing or using ASTRA under an authorized grant, the Licensee agrees to comply with these terms.

